# This example needs NO DeFarm API key — that is the whole point.
# It reads a token's verified content from public infrastructure:
#   - one public, no-auth call to DeFarm's /verify endpoint, used ONLY as an
#     index to resolve a DFID to its IPFS CID + Stellar transaction;
#   - the content itself from public IPFS gateways;
#   - the anchor from Stellar's own Horizon API;
#   - the Ed25519 authorship check runs locally, in this process.

# Where the public verify index lives (default is fine). This is the only
# DeFarm touch, and only to turn a DFID into a CID.
# DEFARM_GATEWAY=https://gateway.defarm.net

# PORT=3007
